  "important_evidence": [
    "We introduce a novel de novo multifunctional AMP design framework that enhances a Feedback Generative Adversarial Network (FBGAN) by integrating a global quantitative AMP activity regression module and a multifunctional-attribute integrated prediction module.",
    "HydrAMP: Extended conditional variational autoencoder, trained for unconstrained and analogue generation of novel active AMPs.",
    "APEX: Deep learning model used to mine all extinct organisms known to science as a source of antibiotic molecules.",
    "AMPpredMFA: uses both bidirectional-LSTMs and CNNs, followed by multihead attention mechanism.",
    "Macrel: random forest model used in AMPSphere.",
    "AMPfinder: BERT-like model incorporating Gene Ontology (OntoProtein) to predict functional types of AMP."
  ],
